error[E0544]: 'append' can only add to a dynamic array, and its first argument is not the address of one
 --> test-code/errors/x64/E0544-append-target-invalid.mu:6:5
  |
4 |     a := [const]Int { 2, 3, 5 }
5 |     b := [dynamic]Int
6 |     append(%a, 2, 3, 5)
  |     ^^^^^^ not the address of a dynamic array
7 |     return 0
  |
  = note: write the address of a variable of the type '[dynamic]T', as in 'append(%numbers, 1)': an
          array, an array slice and any other type cannot be appended to
